sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    participant C as Carol
    A->B: solid open
    A-->B: dotted open
    A->>B: solid arrow
    A-->>B: dotted arrow
    B-xC: solid cross
    B--xC: dotted cross
    C-)A: solid async
    C--)A: dotted async
    A<<->>B: bidirectional
    A->>+B: activate
    B->>+C: nested
    C-->>-B: done
    B-->>-A: reply
    Note left of A: left note
    Note over B,C: spanning note
    opt optional
        A->>C: maybe
    end
    par first
        A->>B: one
    and second
        A->>C: two
    end
    critical connect
        B->>C: open
    option timeout
        B->>A: retry
    end
    break failure
        C->>A: abort
    end
    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
        A->>A: self call
    end
